  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "English: Libmem.NET 2.4.0 adds read-only AssemblyManager.ReadAlignedCode with instruction-boundary and complete-read checks, and SymbolManager.TryFindAddress with false/zero on normal symbol misses. It includes x64/x86 runtime, external-process, Hook/VMT and independent NuGet consumer regression coverage. Existing FindAddress behavior, public signatures, native libmem revision and Windows x64/x86 .NET 8 support remain unchanged. 中文：Libmem.NET 2.4.0 新增只读的指令对齐代码读取 ReadAlignedCode（校验完整读取）和符号查询 TryFindAddress（正常未找到返回 false 与地址零值）；补充双架构、外部进程、Hook/VMT 与独立 NuGet 消费者测试。保留 FindAddress 原有语义、旧版公共 API、固定 native libmem 和 Windows x64/x86 .NET 8 支持。Full notes / 完整说明: https://github.com/CardResearchLab/Libmem.NET/blob/main/docs/releases/v2.4.0.md",
